{"parse": {"title": "TMW-04", "pageid": 119354, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-03\" title=\"TMW-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TMW-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-05\" title=\"TMW-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TMW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9B.AA.E5.A4.9C.E5.BF.AB.E8.BD.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"雪夜快车\">雪夜快车</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 雪夜快车</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Midnight Piercer</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>循<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>瑙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>河<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蓝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>旋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>律<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>前<span class=\"color-value\"></span>进<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3110104</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_chezhan1\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_chezhan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伴随一声急促的鸣笛，列车终于启动，开足马力行驶在一望无际的漆黑原野上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_waijing\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_waijing\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"125\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"854\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>呼……终于发车了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一路悬着的心终于轻轻落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>等到了布达佩斯，我得想想该做些什么……先吃一大份卡帕玛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>不，不对。还是得先找份工作……然后再吃卡帕玛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>找工作是为了卡帕玛，吃卡帕玛是为了找工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩拿出挂在身侧的卡瓦尔长笛，手指在细小的裂纹上轻轻摩挲着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-641812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-641812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-641812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>妈妈……布达佩斯的卡帕玛，会和你做的味道一样好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她望着窗外连绵起伏的群山，好像见到了那个在山中独自奔跑的身影。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身影穿过墓园，踩过腐烂的橙子，天空低垂得像要塌下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哦，还有声音。发疯一般的、女人的呐喊声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>不管怎么说，妈妈，我会先填饱肚子，活下去再说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩吸了吸鼻子，小心翼翼地收起木笛，环顾车厢四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>塞梅尔维斯她，应该短时间内不会回来了吧……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_chexiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_chexiang\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_chexiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiang.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiang.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiang.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>调查那些会造成影响的“表里不一”，就是我的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>你知道血食怪的传说吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>要知道，血食怪可不是这列车上唯一危险的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>虽然她请我吃了美味的牛肉炖菜和云雀蛋糕，但她似乎对血食怪很感兴趣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……不行，还是早点离开为妙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩跳下座位准备离开，犹豫了一会儿，又从口袋里数出两枚硬币放在桌子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>原谅我吧，好心的塞梅尔维斯小姐。有机会我一定会报答您的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下定决心，女孩回过头去，准备寻找下一个栖身之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-641810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-641810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-641810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……哎呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>呜呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>安娜贝尔和她的，嗝，朋友走丢了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>呃……你的朋友总不至于被人打开车窗丢出去了吧，只要把列车从里到外都翻上一遍，总会找到的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>别着急哦，耐心是一种美德……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩匆忙地准备离开，衣摆却被紧紧攥住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>姐姐，帮帮安娜贝尔……安娜贝尔现在不知道自己在哪个车厢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可怜的哭声不绝于耳，足以飘至三个车厢外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一番纠缠后，野树莓不得不使出最后的“杀手锏”——她摘下帽子，露出一截小小的尖牙与暗红色瞳仁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>不、不许哭！我可是血食怪喔，再哭我就咬断你的脖子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>真的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有恐惧，也没有厌恶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她得到的是听众越发好奇的、天真的疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>呃，你不怕血食怪吗？红眼睛的血食怪——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>野树莓又凑近了些，拉下眼睑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>哇……好漂亮的眼睛！像红红的宝石！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>宝石？我还是第一次听人这么形容……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>向来独行的血食怪不知所措地红了脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>像宝石，也像大马士革的红玫瑰！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>玫瑰？这……当然，还是永远不会凋谢的那一种！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你还有什么好听的、夸血食怪的话，都说给我听听！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩兴奋地围着野树莓转悠，像小狗一样在她身上轻轻蹭着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>多萝西老师不让我们读血食怪的故事，说那样学不到知识，也缺乏教养，可、可是，血食怪多厉害呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>我有偷偷看那些书，我知道纯种的血食怪是最厉害的，他们都住在大大的城堡里！姐姐肯定也一样吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>当、当然！既然你都这么问了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>那我可就要跟你讲讲我荣耀的祖先们了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她假意轻咳，双手一拍，随即将自己的荣耀历史一一道来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_tongdao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_tongdao\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_tongdao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Cg-3_1_at_tongdao.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_tongdao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Cg-3_1_at_tongdao.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_tongdao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Cg-3_1_at_tongdao.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_tongdao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>在很早很早以前的……总之是很早之前的哪一年，特别特别早的一个时候吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我最最了不起的祖先，把那些从东边来的人狠狠地揍了一顿。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_tongdao2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_tongdao2_zone\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_tongdao2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/53/Cg-3_1_at_tongdao2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"964\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"212\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>对，没错，他就是大名鼎鼎的穿刺公！人称“德古拉”的阿诺德——阿诺德五世！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-637401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-637401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-637401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>德古拉！德古拉！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"125\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"854\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>太爷爷阿诺德活了一百五十五岁，最后心脏被木桩狠狠刺中，鲜血流尽而死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>咦，那你今年多少大了呀，姐姐？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_tongdao2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_tongdao2_zone\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_tongdao2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/53/Cg-3_1_at_tongdao2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"964\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"212\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>叫我野树莓就好！我今年十四岁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>噢不，是二百一十四岁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她急忙纠正自己。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_xixueguijiazu\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_xixueguijiazu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"125\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_xixueguijiazu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"854\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>两个一百岁，再加上两个七岁，就是我的年纪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>当然，这在我们血食怪种族里，还是非常年轻的……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_meigula.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_meigula\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_meigula\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_1_at_meigula.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_meigula.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_1_at_meigula.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_meigula.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_1_at_meigula.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_meigula.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女热烈地诉说自己记忆里的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们从无数个下着雪的冬季中走来。万籁寂静，炉火烧得正旺，女孩趴在母亲的膝盖上，双眼微合，几乎就要睡着了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeizhengyan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲜血、夜、墓碑……她缠着母亲一遍又一遍地讲述着独属于她的瑰丽传说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的声音越来越轻，越来越沉……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeibiyan_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeibiyan_zone\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeibiyan_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ec/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeibiyan_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"435\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"364\" data-file-height=\"264\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩于是又睡上了一个甜甜的觉，一夜好梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>血食怪……？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_waijing\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_waijing\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"125\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"854\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛被无形的魔法牵引着，孩子们一个接一个地围拢过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>威廉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只落单的小鸟终于找到伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>终于找到你们了！我来介绍一下，她叫野树莓——一位真正的血食怪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩童Ⅰ：</div><div>哇，是活着的血食怪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们激动不已。然而一个男孩却应声从阴影中走了出来，表情不屑一顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小威廉：</div><div>哼……你说你是血食怪，可你只会讲故事，什么证据都没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩童Ⅱ：</div><div>对、对哦，这些故事我们也听过呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>她……她不一样！她有一双红色的眼睛哦，像红宝石一样的红色！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小威廉：</div><div>可是，亨利叔叔生病的时候，眼睛也是红的呀。你还记得吗？当时你还悄悄和我说，亨利叔叔也是血食怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小威廉：</div><div>多萝西老师还训了我们一顿，说我们对亨利叔叔太没礼貌……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>别、别听他的，姐姐！我知道你就是真的血食怪，我说得对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>当……当然是真的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩涨红了脸，决心捍卫血食怪一族的荣耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>想要证据是吧……那就给你们展示一下，真正的血食怪是什么样的！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitiaowu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯光之下，她随意左右走动了几步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>喏，你们能找见我的影子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>影子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩童Ⅱ：</div><div>哇……真的没有影子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯光照亮了每一个孩子，每一张脸，每一双手，每一道影子——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯独她站在光中，却又像是被光绕开了似的，仿佛她本就无需遵从影子的律法，也不属于这个被光照亮的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我们血食怪，是不会被照出影子的喔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子们：</div><div>血食怪！血食怪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩童们兴奋地鼓起掌来，欢呼一声高过一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小威廉：</div><div>这……现在我宣布，这是确凿的、无疑的血食怪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>哼哼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>得意还没持续一会儿，下一个难题就接踵而至。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩童Ⅰ：</div><div>既然你是血食怪，那一定什么都不怕了！你敢和那个很吓人的列车长说话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>列、列车长？咳……说话算什么，我和她可是顶要好的朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>别看她块头那么大，其实反应很迟钝，这一路少不了我的帮忙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们歆羡不已地望着女孩，眼里的崇拜几乎溢满了整个车厢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小威廉：</div><div>哇……以后你就是我们的老大！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子们：</div><div>老大！老大！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩在一阵恭维声中晕眩不已，逐渐迷失自我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>嗯哼，既然你们强烈要求，那我只能勉为其难收了你们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>看来你玩得很开心啊，朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个阴沉的声音从背后响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你、你都听见了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我们刚进车厢，就听见你聊起列车长。真高兴你们相处得这么好呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>块头大，反应迟钝？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我们在玩游戏呢，哈哈，哈哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>玩游戏可以，但不能阻碍车厢的过道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>放心，咱们可是好……好朋友，这点请求不算什么。我们会注意的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>这些是你的新朋友们吗，野树莓小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员的眼神在女孩与孩童们中间不住地逡巡着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>准确来说，他们是我的……嗯……应该是“跟班”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>对吧，伙计们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她努努鼻子，为自己新“收服”了“随从”而骄傲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>没错！我们是尊贵的血食……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>咳咳咳！这里太挤了，身为老大，我需要一个更加宽敞的“城堡”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩火速打断了这个危险的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>等到了新城堡，我还可以给大伙儿讲一些新的、关于“那个”的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>那个？噢……那个！那个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子们：</div><div>新故事！新故事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧闹声远去，车厢再度回归往日的宁静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>真叫人羡慕呀，野树莓小姐能交到这么多朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>为什么，你没有朋友吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员偷偷看了一眼列车长，欲言又止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>哎呀，我想我们还是先回去吧……!塞梅尔维斯小姐还在等着呢!</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>嗯，走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离开前，乘务员担忧地回望向那位调皮的乘客，想起她帽檐阴影下的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以及那双漂亮得不似真实的血色双瞳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-637311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-637311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-637311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>野树莓……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TMW-04"}}